{"id":"siquiera","lemma":"siquiera","pos":"adv","rank":247,"glosses":["at least, at the least","even"],"ipa":"/siˈkjeɾa/","examples":[{"text":"¿Ni siquiera me vas a decir tu nombre?","en":"Aren't you even going to tell me your name?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/943560","words":[{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to say"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"name"}]},{"text":"No nos hemos dado ni siquiera un beso.","en":"We haven't even kissed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460285","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"heme","l":"hemo"},{"g":"a die or dice"},{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"kiss"}]},{"text":"Ni siquiera yo puedo creerlo.","en":"Even I can't believe that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581647","words":[{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"}]},{"text":"No sabes ni siquiera mi nombre.","en":"You don't even know my name.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518761","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null,{"g":"my"},{"g":"name"}]},{"text":"¿Cómo sabes siquiera si quiero ese trabajo?","en":"How do you know I even want that job?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/540710","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},null,{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"work, job"}]}]}